Swami\/Interaction_DragView","type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Reproduces the runner reference’s fixed layer hierarchy and framing: a full-screen","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"magenta canvas and a centered white card. The card maps ","type":"text"},{"code":"origami.Drag","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":" Position to","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"its offset. Release projects momentum, applies the Drag patch’s logical bounds, and","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"pulses Reset when both position axes are within the placed graph’s 100-point center","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"tolerance.","type":"text"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"Interaction_DragView","role":"symbol"}}}